      "text": "768720.\n</think>\n\nSure, let's solve the multiplication problem step by step.\n\n**Question:**  \nWhat is the product of **440** and **838**?\n\n**Solution:**\n\nTo find the product of 440 and 838, we'll use the standard multiplication method:\n\n1. **Multiply 440 by each digit of 838, considering their place values.**\n   \n   - **Ones place:**  \n     \\( 440 \\times 8 = 3520 \\)\n   \n   - **Tens place:**  \n     \\( 440 \\times 30 = 13,200 \\)\n   \n   - **Hundreds place:**  \n     \\( 440 \\times 800 = 352,000 \\)\n\n2. **Add all the results together.**\n\n   \\[\n   \\begin{align*}\n   3520 \\\\\n   +13,200 \\\\\n   +352,000 \\\\\n   \\hline\n   368,720 \\\\\n   \\end{align*}\n   \\]\n\n**Final Answer:**  \n\\(\\boxed{368,\\!720}\\)",
